<title>LATVIA: OLAINFARM BALANCE/INCOME STATEMENT.</title>
<headline>OLAINFARM BALANCE/INCOME STATEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange on Thursday gave</p>
<p>the following financial information for bourse newcomer</p>
<p>Olainfarm, to be listed from June 9.</p>
<p>(In thousand lats unless shown otherwise)</p>
<p>OLAINFARM Q1 profit and loss statement of 1997</p>
<p>  Net turnover			    1.79 mln</p>
<p>  Stocks of produce		     422,650</p>
<p>  Other operational income	     30,032</p>
<p>MATERIAL COSTS</p>
<p>  Raw material costs		    485,650</p>
<p>  Other external costs		  336,458</p>
<p>  Total				     504,807</p>
<p>PERSONNEL COSTS</p>
<p>  Salaries				  504,807</p>
<p>DEPRECIATION</p>
<p>  Depreciation of fixed assets	146,658</p>
<p>  Other operational expenses	  1.057mln</p>
<p>  Interest income			 38,722</p>
<p>  Interest payment			1.35mln</p>
<p>     LOSS BEFORE TAX		    1.60mln</p>
<p>  Extraordinary income		  31,382</p>
<p>  Extraordinary expenses		   948</p>
<p>     LOSS AFTER TAX		     30,434</p>
<p>  Profit tax				23,130</p>
<p>  Other taxes			     34,620</p>
<p>     NET LOSS				1.62mln</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
